  "enabledByDefault": false,
  "target": "",
  "dependencies": [],
  "commands": [],
  "notes": "Clicks are counted in the chat like the browser's click detail (single, double, triple); held Shift/Ctrl/Alt and Backspace/Delete count as modifiers. Which message types can be replied to follows the types Discord documents (MessageTypeSets.REPLYABLE only exists at runtime in Discord's client). Copies confirm with upstream's toasts (\"Link copied!\") and a missing permission warns (\"Cannot pin: Missing permissions\"). Open Thread opens the message's thread, or starts one as Create Thread does, asking for its name. Delete on a message MessageLogger kept takes it off the screen. The reaction settings have a Pick Emoji button."
